                                                <a class="asic-button asic-button--secondary" href="https://asicconnect.asic.gov.au/public/faces/GetStarted">Sign up</a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="portal-tab-content" data-group="select-my-task-bn" id="content-bn-transfer" hidden="">
                                        <p>The ASIC Connect portal will allow you to:</p>
                                        <ul>
