<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Financial requirements (for example, solvency and cash)</p>
</td>
<td>
<p>Regulatory Guide 166 <em>AFS Licensing: Financial requirements </em>(<a href="/regulatory-resources/find-a-document/regulatory-guides/rg-166-afs-licensing-financial-requirements" title="RG 166 AFS licensing: Financial requirements">RG 166</a>)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Responsible managers (qualifications and experience)</p>
</td>
