<p>Regulatory Guide 146 <em>Licensing: Training of financial product advisers </em>(<a href="/regulatory-resources/find-a-document/regulatory-guides/rg-146-licensing-training-of-financial-product-advisers" title="RG 146 Licensing: Training of financial product advisers">RG 146</a>)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<p>General compliance and risk management</p>
</td>
<td>
<p>Regulatory Guide 104 <em>AFS </em><em>Licensing: Meeting the general obligations</em> (<a href="/regulatory-resources/find-a-document/regulatory-guides/rg-104-afs-licensing-meeting-the-general-obligations" title="RG 104 AFS licensing: Meeting the general obligations">RG 104</a>)</p>
<p>Regulatory Guide 259 <em>Risk management systems of responsible entities </em>(<a href="/regulatory-resources/find-a-document/regulatory-guides/rg-259-risk-management-systems-of-fund-operators" title="RG 259 Risk management systems of fund operators">RG 259</a>)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
