</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Managing conflicts of interest</p>
</td>
<td>
<p>Regulatory Guide 181<em> AFS l</em><em>icensing: Managing conflicts of interest </em>(<a href="/regulatory-resources/find-a-document/regulatory-guides/rg-181-afs-licensing-managing-conflicts-of-interest" title="RG 181 Licensing: Managing conflicts of interest">RG 181</a>)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<p>Dispute resolution (internal and external)</p>
</td>
<td>
<p>Regulatory Guide 271 <em>Internal dispute resolution</em> (<a href="/regulatory-resources/find-a-document/regulatory-guides/rg-271-internal-dispute-resolution" title="RG 271 Internal dispute resolution">RG 271</a>)</p>
<p>Regulatory Guide 267 <em>Oversight of the Australian Financial Complaints Authority </em>(<a href="/regulatory-resources/find-a-document/regulatory-guides/rg-267-oversight-of-the-australian-financial-complaints-authority" title="RG 267 Oversight of the Australian Financial Complaints Authority">RG 267</a>)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
